cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite Mbed TLS.
title: Mbed TLS 4.1.1 with TF-PSA-Crypto (vendored)
abstract: >-
  The crypto core and X.509 parse/write the guests use. Copied unmodified from the org's engine
  fork (entities-godot, tag v2026.09.19.1621-main-fabric-0.2.4, thirdparty/mbedtls), which vendors
  upstream 4.1.1; that fork's Godot-specific config directory is left out, and the guests use
  src/mbedtls_config/ instead.
authors:
  - name: The Mbed TLS Contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls
